2dc6a59d.jpg Space: a special skill for every captain Every captain class now has a special skill on Space, usable by day or by night. It sits next to Q and C on the skill bar with its own cooldown. {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/46240671/364c76a595ddf8713af28c73463d381","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-18T18:07:03Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706687685","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:03:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4859610-1846018067941609","game_id":"steam-4859610","kind":"update","title":"v1.977 update: new captain looks, difficulty tuning, and many fixes","summary":"Captains A new look for all five captain classes and their ascension forms: a refreshed art style. Armor, boots and trinkets now change on the captain as your gear tier rises. Capes now move with spring physics (turned off on the Low graphics tier). Captains also carry their tools while gathering. New Appearance row in the Armory: follow your equipment progress, or pick a full Basic, Advanced or Final set. Cosmetic only - stats are unchanged, and it applies from your next run. In co-op, teammate","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-12T16:53:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067941609","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:03:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4859610-1845383656397182","game_id":"steam-4859610","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update: Broken Stele's Night & Reworked Boss Fights","summary":"Hi everyone, This demo update (v1.976) gives Broken Stele his own boss night in 1-3, reworks the boss fights and cleans up a lot of on-screen text. We've also improved rebuilding and the wall-repair supply card, and fixed issues with card picks, co-op, display and sound. Broken Stele's night (1-3) A boss night. In 1-3, Broken Stele now appears on the third night, with two Broken Stele Lieutenants walking beside and behind him. Defeat him to hold the night. An entrance to war drums. When he arriv","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-06T17:29:20Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656397182","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:03:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4859610-1845383656377325","game_id":"steam-4859610","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update v1.974: HD Animations, Clearer Card Effects, Co-op Fixes","summary":"Hi everyone, v1.974 brings HD animations, clearer card effects and a round of co-op fixes to the demo. Here's what you'll notice on the battlefield. HD animations HD units. Recruitable soldiers, allies and most enemies now have HD animations, and hits land when the weapon connects, not during the wind-up. Bloated corpses warn you. A green ring marks the area before one bursts. A sharper captain at 1080p, and victory screens now show the map's illustration full-screen. Clearer card effects Slows ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-30T12:03:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656377325","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:03:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4859610-1842846814450472","game_id":"steam-4859610","kind":"announcement","title":"Two New Outposts, New Cards and Gear — Hold-Ring Defence and a Sharper Endless Mode","summary":"Update 1.972 brings two new outposts, new cards and gear, hold-ring defence, and Endless improvements. Three returning outposts also receive adjustments, linking five stops on your vigil; whether you’ve tried the demo or have us wishlisted, gather your squad for another march. Two New Outposts The Felled Woods — Choose a forest route toward Ash Mouth. Footsteps build Commotion; campfires calm it and restore health. Fill the bar and a corpse tide surges along the road. Follow Ash Mouth’s campfire","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-06T09:53:03Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814450472","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:03:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4859610-1841579228674373","game_id":"steam-4859610","kind":"update","title":"Update: Co-op Polish","summary":"Co-op Your teammates' soldiers now carry their full combat presence to your screen: arrows and shots in flight, hits landing, melee, and the heavy note of a soldier going down. Addressed a freeze where a player caught in a dialogue moment could be stuck after their teammate finished a card pick, which could also stop upgrade cards from being offered for the rest of the run. Addressed a case where rejoining a co-op run could hand a player the same dawn recruitment card twice. In regular runs, whe","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-24T01:59:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228674373","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:03:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4859610-1841579228673185","game_id":"steam-4859610","kind":"update","title":"Patch: Co-op Card Pick Freeze Fix, Plus a Smoother First Hour","summary":"Co-op Fixed a co-op freeze that could leave card picks showing \"waiting for teammate\" for up to 45 seconds even after your teammate had picked. We found this thanks to a player's in-game F8 report — thank you for sending it in. We're continuing to monitor co-op sync closely; if anything still feels off, F8 is the fastest way to reach us. Fixes Knight: element-card rounds no longer count against the dawn recruitment guarantee. Solo: removed the \"(30s)\" countdown from card picks — solo picks are u","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-23T11:09:36Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228673185","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:03:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4859610-1841579228671616","game_id":"steam-4859610","kind":"update","title":"Patch Notes: Co-op Fixes, and What Comes After the Last Night","summary":"Co-op Fixed: the joining player's squad no longer fails to refill during the day — this is the issue mentioned in the last update, and squads will stop shrinking night by night. The colossus now walks and sounds like it on the joining player's screen. Whoever finishes picking an upgrade first no longer starts moving early; both sides unlock together. The war-prep and blood-moon supply panels now auto-choose after 30 seconds, so one player stepping away no longer stalls the run. Also Fixed the so","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-22T15:20:25Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228671616","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:03:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4859610-1841579228670984","game_id":"steam-4859610","kind":"update","title":"Content Update: Endless Goes Deeper, Night One Reworked","summary":"v1.960 puts two things front and center: a redesigned pace for Endless Mode, and a full rework of Chapter 1, Night One. Endless now opens in a way that catches you, and your daytime preparation genuinely changes how Night One goes. Endless Mode, Now With Depth We looked at the data: too many Endless runs are over within the first few minutes. This batch rewrites the difficulty curve itself — easing the early stretch and tightening later — alongside changes to how the opening supports you and wha","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-22T08:19:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228670984","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:03:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4859610-1840944183787668","game_id":"steam-4859610","kind":"announcement","title":"We Heard You — Round Two: Clearer Builds, a Rebalanced Blood Moon","summary":"Last time we said \"we heard you.\" Here is round two — three things: the Blood Moon night rebalanced, builds you can finally read, and co-op waits and countdowns that stay in step. The Blood Moon is worth another stand Fell at the Blood Moon before? It's worth making another stand. We rebalanced enemy strength in mission 1-4: the horde's scale and pressure remain, but enemies are no longer damage sponges — your build gets a real chance to come online. Gear you can actually read The equipment syst","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-18T02:27:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183787668","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:03:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4859610-1840944183785488","game_id":"steam-4859610","kind":"update","title":"Unburied Hotfix — Co-op and Mission Completion Fixes","summary":"Thank you for the detailed reports. This hotfix addresses issues affecting co-op campaign runs: Fixed a card-selection synchronization issue that could leave both players waiting for each other after they had already chosen. Fixed an issue where the third campaign mission could fail to end after the Colossus was defeated. Fixed a related countdown crash that could occur when the card-selection state became stuck. Restored the downed-state respawn countdown and the third mission's night-by-night ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-17T09:15:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183785488","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:03:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4859610-1840944183783320","game_id":"steam-4859610","kind":"update","title":"Unburied Hotfix — Fixes Based on Your Reports","summary":"Since the demo opened, players have used the in-game F8 report to tell us about problems — precisely described, some with reproduction steps. We chased them down and fixed the most serious one. In this hotfix Multiplayer pick screen froze permanently — if a teammate disconnected mid-pick, the game stopped forever on the \"waiting for teammate to choose a card\" countdown, frozen and unrecoverable. The disconnect cleanup ran one step behind the connection teardown, so it was skipped entirely. Fixed","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-16T05:00:05Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183783320","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:03:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4859610-1840944183781944","game_id":"steam-4859610","kind":"announcement","title":"Before the Blood Moon — You Have Intel and a Choice","summary":"First, to be clear: this batch is not a reaction to the recently released prologue — we are still watching how it performs. These are the first round of improvements drawn from several days of play data and feedback since the demo opened, addressing confirmed issues around Blood Moon preparation, mode entry, and display. We said \"we hear you,\" and the direction is not softening the night. It's making sure that before the worst night comes, you can read the danger, prepare for it, and know what t","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-15T11:30:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183781944","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:03:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4859610-1840944183776482","game_id":"steam-4859610","kind":"update","title":"Unburied — Update: \"The Fall Night\" — a playable prologue of the night the kingdom fell","summary":"Every vigil begins with a defeat. This update adds a story prologue. Years before your first watch, the royal city fell in a single night — and you were there. Not as a Warden, but as a captain on the wall: the alarm bell, the tide of dead pouring out of the dark, each wave larger and hungrier than the last. There is no winning this night. Everything in Unburied begins here. As for what exactly happened on that wall — go see it yourself. In this update New playable prologue, \"The Fall Night\" — a","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-13T11:33:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183776482","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:03:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4859610-1840310314350427","game_id":"steam-4859610","kind":"announcement","title":"The Unburied demo is out — three vigils, and one night that never ends","summary":"The demo is available now. What's in it: Three full campaign vigils — from the first alarm at a border outpost, through a blood-moon hunt, to the Bursting Front: a bone colossus wakes on the third night and starts walking at your gate. Endless — a vigil with no end, where dawn never really arrives. See how many nights your line holds. Full 1-4 player online co-op — invite friends straight through Steam and hold the same wall together. Twitch integration — turn it on and your chat joins the vigil","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-10T06:23:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314350427","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:03:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4859610-1839676055893883","game_id":"steam-4859610","kind":"announcement","title":"Unburied — store page is live. Hold the line until dawn, alone or with three.","summary":"The Unburied King is dead, and will not rest.His army carries him home, night after night. Everywhere the procession passes, the dead sleeping under that ground wake and fall in behind it. The Wardens are not here to escort him. They are here to end him before he reaches his door.The Unburied store page is now live. A top-down survival tower-defense roguelite for one to four players online.Build by day. Hold by night. Split up to gather, wall, and raise towers while the light lasts — resources a","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-03T05:25:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055893883","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:03:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4859610":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:52:02Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:52:01Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4859610":"2026-10-26T14:52:02Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4859610":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:52:01Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T14:52:01Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:52:01Z"},"5044890":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:52:02Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T14:52:02Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:52:02Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4859610","app_id":4859610,"app